{"title":"MATHCOUNTS historical results","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This is the <b>MATHCOUNTS historical results</b> page.  Post <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MATHCOUNTS\" title=\"MATHCOUNTS\">MATHCOUNTS</a> statistics and lists of high scorers here so that the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MATHCOUNTS\" title=\"MATHCOUNTS\">MATHCOUNTS page</a> doesn't get cluttered.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#National_Team_Champions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National Team Champions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Countdown_Round_Champions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Countdown Round Champions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Masters_Round_Winners\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Masters Round Winners</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Written_Test_Champions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Written Test Champions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Most_Improved_Team\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Most Improved Team</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Spirit_Stick_Winners\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Spirit Stick Winners</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#National_Competition_Sites\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=